# Optional — see docs/PHOTO-CURATION.md
# VITE_ prefix exposes vars to the browser at build time (Railway: set as service variables).

# Pexels — free at https://www.pexels.com/api/ (runtime fallback for landmarks/hotels)
# VITE_PEXELS_API_KEY=

# TripAdvisor Content API — https://www.tripadvisor.com/developers
# Prefer scripts/curate-venue-images.mjs for one-time curation; runtime needs dev proxy (CORS).
# VITE_TRIPADVISOR_API_KEY=

# Used by scripts/curate-venue-images.mjs (not bundled into the app)
# TRIPADVISOR_API_KEY=
# PEXELS_API_KEY=
